  "body": "Welcome to 38 Ngataringa Road, where charm, comfort and opportunity come together.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for a home that’s ready to move straight into, with the added bonus of exciting future potential, this property deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nBuilt in solid brick and tile, this beautifully presented home has been tastefully updated throughout, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere from the moment you step inside. Cosy in winter and cool in summer, it offers relaxed, easy-care living all year round.\r\n\r\nStep outside onto the entertaining deck and take in the city skyline views. Whether you’re enjoying your morning coffee, firing up the barbecue or entertaining family and friends, this is a wonderful space to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nBut there’s more to this property than meets the eye!\r\n\r\nPositioned on a freehold site, the property offers exciting subdivision possibilities. With potential to build an additional dwelling or subdivide and sell a portion of the land, subject to council approval, there’s an opportunity to unlock further value.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a homeowner seeking a move-in-ready property, an investor looking for future potential, or a buyer with an eye for opportunity, 38 Ngataringa Road offers the best of both worlds.\r\n\r\nMove in and enjoy today, while exploring the possibilities for tomorrow.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself. We look forward to showing you through!",
